  "notes": "支付金额及时刷新，连接更稳。\n\n- 支付通道调整余额抵扣与待付金额后，订单和钱包会及时刷新；请重新确认金额后继续付款，旧支付链接不会复用。\n- Windows TUN 服务安装失败时显示具体步骤、错误码和处理建议，兼容智能应用控制和企业策略。\n- 同一订阅同时刷新不再互相覆盖，刚改的名称、链接、更新间隔不会被还原。\n- 改密码、两步验证等一次性操作只在确定未发出时才改走直连，避免重复提交。\n- 节点诊断指纹不再包含账号凭据，退出登录时清除本地消息缓存。\n",
  "notesEn": "Current payment amounts and steadier connections.\n\n- Orders and wallet balances refresh when a payment channel adjusts the balance deduction and remaining payment. Review the updated amount before continuing; old payment links are discarded.\n- Windows TUN service installation reports the failed step, error code, and recovery advice, including installations subject to Smart App Control or enterprise policies.\n- Concurrent subscription refreshes preserve your latest name, address, and refresh interval changes.\n- Password and two-step verification operations use a direct connection only when the first request was never sent, avoiding duplicate submissions.\n- Diagnostic node fingerprints no longer include account credentials, and signing out clears the local message cache.\n",
